            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Influence on Art</strong><br>\nCourbet's work had a significant influence on the development of modern art. His commitment to depicting reality as he saw it helped lay the groundwork for subsequent movements, including Impressionism and Post-Impressionism.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Controversies</strong><br>\nThroughout his career, Courbet was involved in several controversies. His artwork often challenged the established norms of the art world, which led to debates about the purpose and morality of art.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legacy</strong><br>\nGustave Courbet's legacy is one of challenging the status quo and pioneering a movement that celebrated the real over the ideal. His influence persists today, encouraging artists to pursue authenticity in their work.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
